# Prolific Website 

> Prolific helps AI developers, researchers, and organizations to gather data from engaged participants. 

Prolific helps researchers build studies using pre-screening, payment, and quality management while offering participants fair compensation.

Prolific also publishes HUMAINE, its human-centered benchmark and leaderboard for frontier language models, which measures model performance in real-world use with evaluations from real people.

